module

public import StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.Blowup.ChartSectionRing
public import StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.Blowup.ExceptionalChart
public import StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.Blowup.ReesAlgebra.ChartMembership
public import StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.Blowup.Transform.StandardChart
public import StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.DivisorFlatPullback.Basic
public import StacksFrontier.RingTheory.AffineBlowup.ModelComparison
public import StacksFrontier.RingTheory.Blowup.SecondCentreFactorization

/-!
# The second centre of a two-step blowup, chart by chart

Let `S` be a scheme, `ℐ` a quasi-coherent sheaf of ideals on `S` and `b : X' ⟶ S` the blowup of
`S` in `ℐ`. Over an affine open `U ⊆ S` the scheme `X'` is covered by the charts
`Spec Γ(S, U)[ℐ(U)/a]`, `a ∈ ℐ(U)`, of [Stacks, Tag 0804]. This file reads a quasi-coherent
sheaf of ideals `𝒦` on `X'` through those charts and produces, for a finite family `a : ι → ℐ(U)`
and `𝒦` of finite type, a `d > 0` and a finitely generated ideal `J ⊆ ℐ(U)ᵈ` of `Γ(S, U)` whose
extension to each chart is `(ℐ(U)·𝒪)ᵈ · 𝒦` — the chart-level half of the second-centre
factorization that the composition theorem for admissible blowups, [Stacks, Tag 080L], consumes.

The commutative algebra is `Stacks.Blowup.exists_fg_le_pow_map_eq_pow_mul` of
`StacksFrontier/RingTheory/Blowup/SecondCentreFactorization.lean`; what is done here is to supply
its three hypotheses from the geometry of the charts.


Alongside this, and in the `AlgebraicGeometry` namespace, the file carries a second reading of
the same charts: `AlgebraicGeometry.blowUpChartOpen` names the affine open of `X'` underlying
the chart at a section `a` of `I` over `U`, identifies its ring of sections with the affine
blowup algebra, and reads on it that the exceptional ideal is generated by the pullback of `a`,
a nonzerodivisor; that every section is a fraction `x / aⁿ` with `x` a section of `Iⁿ`; that the
pullback of a section of `Iⁿ` is divisible by `aⁿ`; and that the inverse image of an ideal sheaf
of the base is the image of its ideal on `U`.

## Main results

* `Stacks.Blowup.chartOpens`, `Stacks.Blowup.chartStructureMap`, `Stacks.Blowup.chartRingIso`:
  the affine open of the blowup underlying the chart attached to `a ∈ ℐ(U)`, the structure map
  of the blowup read on it, and its identification with the affine blowup algebra.
* `Stacks.Blowup.iSup_opensRange_blowUpAffineChart_of_span`: the charts attached to a family of
  sections generating `ℐ(U)` already cover `b⁻¹(U)`, so a finite generating family gives a
  finite cover.
* `Stacks.Blowup.map_chartStructureMap_ideal` and
  `Stacks.Blowup.exists_pow_mul_eq_chartStructureMap`: the centre is principal on a chart, and
  every section there is a fraction `x / aⁿ` with `x ∈ ℐ(U)ⁿ`.
* `Stacks.Blowup.exists_mul_eq_and_basicOpen_le` and `Stacks.Blowup.exists_pow_mul_mem_chart`:
  the transition section `b / a` between two charts, and the clearing of denominators across
  the overlap that it powers.
* `Stacks.Blowup.exists_fg_le_pow_and_map_chartStructureMap_eq` and its degree-free form
  `Stacks.Blowup.exists_pos_forall_ge_fg_le_pow_and_map_chartStructureMap_eq`.

* `AlgebraicGeometry.blowUpChartOpen`, `AlgebraicGeometry.blowUpChartMap` and
  `AlgebraicGeometry.blowUpChartRingIso`: the same chart, its map of sections from `U` and its
  ring of sections, in the `AlgebraicGeometry` namespace.
* `AlgebraicGeometry.ideal_exceptionalIdeal_blowUpChartOpen`,
  `AlgebraicGeometry.blowUpChartMap_self_mem_nonZeroDivisors`,
  `AlgebraicGeometry.exists_mem_pow_mul_eq_blowUpChartMap`,
  `AlgebraicGeometry.exists_mul_eq_blowUpChartMap_of_mem_pow` and
  `AlgebraicGeometry.ideal_comap_blowUpToBase_blowUpChartOpen`: the four facts above.

## Implementation notes

The charts are indexed by sections, not by points, and the comparison between two of them is
made on the locus where the transition section is invertible. That locus is identified with the
overlap through `AlgebraicGeometry.Proj.awayι_preimage_basicOpen`, transported along
`Stacks.Blowup.reesAwayEquivAffineBlowup`; `Stacks.Blowup.preimage_chartOpens` is the result.
Once the overlap is a basic open of the chart, its sections are a localization
(`AlgebraicGeometry.IsAffineOpen.isLocalization_basicOpen`) and the ideal of `𝒦` on it is the
image of the ideal on either chart (`Scheme.IdealSheafData.map_ideal`), which is exactly what
clearing denominators needs. The cancellation at the end uses that the image of `a` on its own
chart is a nonzerodivisor, which stays one in the localization.

The structure maps of two charts agree over the overlap for free, because each of them is a
`Scheme.Hom.appLE` of the single morphism `b` and `Scheme.Hom.appLE_map` composes those with
restrictions. This is why the charts are presented through `Scheme.Hom.appLE` rather than
through the ring maps of the affine blowup algebras.


The two namespaces hold parallel dictionaries for the same charts: `Stacks.Blowup.chartOpens`
and `AlgebraicGeometry.blowUpChartOpen` name the same affine open, and the lemmas around them
correspond one to one. They are not yet unified.

## References

* [Stacks Project, Tag 02OS](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/02OS)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 0803](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0803)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 0804](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0804)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 080L](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/080L)
-/

@[expose] public noncomputable section

universe u

namespace AlgebraicGeometry

open CategoryTheory TopologicalSpace

variable {X : Scheme.{u}} (I : X.IdealSheafData)

/-- The affine open of the blowup underlying the standard chart at a section `a` of `I` over an
affine open `U` of the base. -/
def blowUpChartOpen (U : X.affineOpens) (a : I.ideal U) : (blowUp I).affineOpens :=
  ⟨blowUpAffineChart I U a ''ᵁ ⊤, (isAffineOpen_top _).image_of_isOpenImmersion _⟩

/-- A chart over the affine open `U` lies over `U`. -/
theorem blowUpChartOpen_le (U : X.affineOpens) (a : I.ideal U) :
    (blowUpChartOpen I U a).1 ≤ blowUpToBase I ⁻¹ᵁ U.1 := by
  rintro x ⟨y, -, rfl⟩
  change (blowUpAffineChart I U a ≫ blowUpToBase I).base y ∈ (U.1 : Set X)
  rw [blowUpAffineChart_comp_blowUpToBase I U a, U.2.isoSpec_inv_ι, Scheme.Hom.comp_apply]
  exact U.2.range_fromSpec.le ⟨_, rfl⟩

/-- The map of sections of the blowup morphism from an affine open of the base to the chart. -/
abbrev blowUpChartMap (U : X.affineOpens) (a : I.ideal U) :
    Γ(X, U.1) ⟶ Γ(blowUp I, (blowUpChartOpen I U a).1) :=
  (blowUpToBase I).appLE U.1 (blowUpChartOpen I U a).1 (blowUpChartOpen_le I U a)

/-- **The sections of the blowup over a chart are the affine blowup algebra.** The chart is an
open immersion of `Spec Γ(X, U)[I(U)/a]`, so it identifies the sections of the blowup over its
image with the global sections of that spectrum. -/
def blowUpChartRingIso (U : X.affineOpens) (a : I.ideal U) :
    Γ(blowUp I, (blowUpChartOpen I U a).1) ≅ CommRingCat.of (blowUpAffineChartRing I U a) :=
  (blowUpAffineChart I U a).appIso ⊤ ≪≫ Scheme.ΓSpecIso _

/-- **The identification of the sections over a chart is one of `Γ(X, U)`-algebras.** The map of
sections of the blowup morphism, read through it, is the structure map of the affine blowup
algebra. -/
theorem blowUpChartMap_comp_ringIso (U : X.affineOpens) (a : I.ideal U) :
    blowUpChartMap I U a ≫ (blowUpChartRingIso I U a).hom =
      CommRingCat.ofHom (algebraMap Γ(X, U.1) (blowUpAffineChartRing I U a)) :=
  appLE_appIso_ΓSpecIso_of_comp (blowUpAffineChart I U a) (blowUpToBase I) U.2
    (blowUpChartOpen_le I U a) (by
      rw [blowUpAffineChart_comp_blowUpToBase I U a, U.2.isoSpec_inv_ι])

/-- The chart identification sends the pullback of a section of the base to its image in the
affine blowup algebra. -/
theorem blowUpChartRingIso_hom_blowUpChartMap (U : X.affineOpens) (a : I.ideal U)
    (r : Γ(X, U.1)) :
    (blowUpChartRingIso I U a).hom.hom ((blowUpChartMap I U a).hom r) =
      (CommRingCat.ofHom (algebraMap Γ(X, U.1) (blowUpAffineChartRing I U a))).hom r := by
  rw [← blowUpChartMap_comp_ringIso I U a]
  rfl

/-- The inverse image of an ideal sheaf of the base, read on a chart of the blowup. -/
theorem ideal_comap_blowUpToBase_blowUpChartOpen (J : X.IdealSheafData) (U : X.affineOpens)
    (a : I.ideal U) :
    (J.comap (blowUpToBase I)).ideal (blowUpChartOpen I U a)
      = (J.ideal U).map (blowUpChartMap I U a).hom :=
  Stacks.IdealSheaf.ideal_comap_appLE J (blowUpToBase I) U _ (blowUpChartOpen_le I U a)

/-- The image of the ideal downstairs lands in the inverse image ideal on a chart. -/
theorem map_le_ideal_comap_blowUpChartOpen (J : X.IdealSheafData) (U : X.affineOpens)
    (a : I.ideal U) :
    (J.ideal U).map (blowUpChartMap I U a).hom
      ≤ (J.comap (blowUpToBase I)).ideal (blowUpChartOpen I U a) :=
  (ideal_comap_blowUpToBase_blowUpChartOpen I J U a).ge

/-- A nonzerodivisor is reflected by a ring isomorphism: the converse direction of
`Stacks.Blowup.mem_nonZeroDivisors_iso`, read off from it at the inverse isomorphism. -/
private theorem mem_nonZeroDivisors_of_iso {A B : CommRingCat.{u}} (e : A ≅ B) {x : A}
    (h : e.hom.hom x ∈ nonZeroDivisors B) : x ∈ nonZeroDivisors A := by
  have h2 := Stacks.Blowup.mem_nonZeroDivisors_iso e.symm h
  rwa [Iso.symm_hom, ← CommRingCat.comp_apply, e.hom_inv_id, CommRingCat.id_apply] at h2

/-- The image of `I(U)` on a chart is generated by the pullback of the denominator. -/
private theorem map_ideal_blowUpChartMap (U : X.affineOpens) (a : I.ideal U) :
    (I.ideal U).map (blowUpChartMap I U a).hom =
      Ideal.span {(blowUpChartMap I U a).hom (a : Γ(X, U.1))} := by
  refine Stacks.IdealSheaf.ideal_map_hom_injective (blowUpChartRingIso I U a) ?_
  rw [Ideal.map_map, Ideal.map_span, Set.image_singleton, blowUpChartRingIso_hom_blowUpChartMap,
    show ((blowUpChartRingIso I U a).hom.hom).comp (blowUpChartMap I U a).hom
      = algebraMap Γ(X, U.1) (blowUpAffineChartRing I U a) from
      RingHom.ext (blowUpChartRingIso_hom_blowUpChartMap I U a)]
  exact affineBlowup_ideal_map (I.ideal U) (a : Γ(X, U.1)) a.2

/-- **On a chart the exceptional ideal is generated by the pullback of the denominator.** -/
theorem ideal_exceptionalIdeal_blowUpChartOpen (U : X.affineOpens) (a : I.ideal U) :
    (exceptionalIdeal I).ideal (blowUpChartOpen I U a) =
      Ideal.span {(blowUpChartMap I U a).hom (a : Γ(X, U.1))} :=
  (ideal_comap_blowUpToBase_blowUpChartOpen I I U a).trans (map_ideal_blowUpChartMap I U a)

/-- The pullback of the denominator to its chart is a nonzerodivisor. -/
theorem blowUpChartMap_self_mem_nonZeroDivisors (U : X.affineOpens) (a : I.ideal U) :
    (blowUpChartMap I U a).hom (a : Γ(X, U.1)) ∈
      nonZeroDivisors Γ(blowUp I, (blowUpChartOpen I U a).1) := by
  refine mem_nonZeroDivisors_of_iso (blowUpChartRingIso I U a) ?_
  rw [blowUpChartRingIso_hom_blowUpChartMap]
  exact isRegular_iff_mem_nonZeroDivisors.mp
    (affineBlowup_isRegular (I.ideal U) (a : Γ(X, U.1)))

/-- **Every section over a chart is a fraction.** -/
theorem exists_mem_pow_mul_eq_blowUpChartMap (U : X.affineOpens) (a : I.ideal U)
    (y : Γ(blowUp I, (blowUpChartOpen I U a).1)) :
    ∃ (n : ℕ) (x : Γ(X, U.1)), x ∈ (I.ideal U) ^ n ∧
      y * (blowUpChartMap I U a).hom (a : Γ(X, U.1)) ^ n = (blowUpChartMap I U a).hom x := by
  set e := blowUpChartRingIso I U a with he
  set z : blowUpAffineChartRing I U a := e.hom.hom y with hz
  have hmem : (z : Localization.Away (a : Γ(X, U.1))) ∈
      Stacks.AffineBlowup.affineBlowupAlgebra (I.ideal U) (a : Γ(X, U.1)) a.2 := by
    rw [Stacks.AffineBlowup.affineBlowupAlgebra_eq_affineBlowupAlgebraAway _ _ a.2,
      affineBlowupAlgebraAway_eq_affineBlowupAlgebra]
    exact z.2
  rw [Stacks.AffineBlowup.mem_affineBlowupAlgebra a.2] at hmem
  obtain ⟨n, x, hx, hxz⟩ := hmem
  refine ⟨n, x, hx, ?_⟩
  have key : e.hom.hom (y * (blowUpChartMap I U a).hom (a : Γ(X, U.1)) ^ n)
      = e.hom.hom ((blowUpChartMap I U a).hom x) := by
    rw [map_mul, map_pow, he, blowUpChartRingIso_hom_blowUpChartMap,
      blowUpChartRingIso_hom_blowUpChartMap, ← he, ← hz]
    exact Subtype.ext (by simpa using hxz)
  exact e.commRingCatIsoToRingEquiv.injective key

/-- The pullback of a section of `Iⁿ` to a chart is divisible by the `n`-th power of the
pullback of the denominator. -/
theorem exists_mul_eq_blowUpChartMap_of_mem_pow (U : X.affineOpens) (a : I.ideal U) {n : ℕ}
    {x : Γ(X, U.1)} (hx : x ∈ (I.ideal U) ^ n) :
    ∃ w : Γ(blowUp I, (blowUpChartOpen I U a).1),
      (blowUpChartMap I U a).hom x =
        (blowUpChartMap I U a).hom (a : Γ(X, U.1)) ^ n * w := by
  have hmem : (blowUpChartMap I U a).hom x ∈
      Ideal.span {(blowUpChartMap I U a).hom (a : Γ(X, U.1)) ^ n} := by
    rw [← Ideal.span_singleton_pow, ← map_ideal_blowUpChartMap I U a, ← Ideal.map_pow]
    exact Ideal.mem_map_of_mem _ hx
  obtain ⟨w, hw⟩ := Ideal.mem_span_singleton'.mp hmem
  exact ⟨w, by rw [← hw, mul_comm]⟩

end AlgebraicGeometry

open AlgebraicGeometry CategoryTheory Limits CommRingCat HomogeneousLocalization Polynomial

namespace Stacks.Blowup

section FiniteCover

variable {R : Type u} [CommRing R] {I : Ideal R} {ι : Type*} [Fintype ι]
  (a : ι → R) (ha : ∀ i, a i ∈ I)

/-- If the elements `a i` generate `I`, then the Rees algebra of `I` is generated over its degree
zero part by the degree-one elements `a i · t`. -/
theorem adjoin_reesGradingZero_range_reesDegOne_eq_top
    (hspan : Ideal.span (Set.range a) = I) :
    Algebra.adjoin (reesGrading I 0) (Set.range fun i ↦ reesDegOne I (ha i)) = ⊤ := by
  rw [← adjoin_reesGradingZero_reesGrading_one_eq_top I]
  refine le_antisymm (Algebra.adjoin_mono ?_) (Algebra.adjoin_le ?_)
  · rintro _ ⟨i, rfl⟩
    exact reesDegOne_mem_reesGrading I (ha i)
  · intro f hf
    have hf1 : f ∈ reesGrading I 1 := hf
    have hc : (f : R[X]).coeff 1 ∈ Ideal.span (Set.range a) := by
      rw [hspan]
      simpa using f.2 1
    obtain ⟨r, hr⟩ := Ideal.mem_span_range_iff_exists_fun.mp hc
    have hfe : f = ∑ i, algebraMap R (reesAlgebra I) (r i) * reesDegOne I (ha i) := by
      apply Subtype.ext
      rw [AddSubmonoidClass.coe_finsetSum, coe_eq_monomial I hf1, ← hr,
        map_sum (monomial 1 : R →ₗ[R] R[X])]
      refine Finset.sum_congr rfl fun i _ ↦ ?_
      rw [Subalgebra.coe_mul, coe_reesDegOne]
      change (monomial 1) (r i * a i) = algebraMap R R[X] (r i) * monomial 1 (a i)
      rw [Polynomial.algebraMap_eq, C_mul_monomial]
    rw [hfe]
    refine sum_mem fun i _ ↦ mul_mem ?_ (Algebra.subset_adjoin ⟨i, rfl⟩)
    exact Subalgebra.algebraMap_mem _
      (⟨_, SetLike.algebraMap_mem_graded (reesGrading I) (r i)⟩ : reesGrading I 0)

/-- If the elements `a i` generate `I`, then the basic opens `D₊(a i · t)` cover `Proj` of the
Rees algebra of `I`. -/
theorem iSup_basicOpen_reesDegOne_range_eq_top (hspan : Ideal.span (Set.range a) = I) :
    ⨆ i, Proj.basicOpen (reesGrading I) (reesDegOne I (ha i)) = ⊤ :=
  Proj.iSup_basicOpen_eq_top' _ _ (fun i ↦ ⟨1, reesDegOne_mem_reesGrading I (ha i)⟩)
    (adjoin_reesGradingZero_range_reesDegOne_eq_top a ha hspan)

/-- If the elements `a i` generate `I`, then the affine blowup charts `Spec R[I/a i]` cover `Proj`
of the Rees algebra of `I`. -/
theorem iSup_opensRange_specAffineBlowupι_range (hspan : Ideal.span (Set.range a) = I) :
    ⨆ i, (specAffineBlowupι I (a i) (ha i)).opensRange = ⊤ := by
  simpa only [opensRange_specAffineBlowupι] using
    iSup_basicOpen_reesDegOne_range_eq_top a ha hspan

end FiniteCover

section SchemeCover

variable {S : Scheme.{u}} (ℐ : S.IdealSheafData) (U : S.affineOpens)
  {ι : Type*} [Fintype ι] (a : ι → Γ(S, U.1)) (ha : ∀ i, a i ∈ ℐ.ideal U)

/-- If the sections `a i` generate `ℐ(U)`, then the charts of the blowup attached to them cover
the inverse image of `U`. -/
theorem iSup_opensRange_blowUpAffineChart_of_span
    (hspan : Ideal.span (Set.range a) = ℐ.ideal U) :
    ⨆ i, (blowUpAffineChart ℐ U (ha i)).opensRange = blowUpToBase ℐ ⁻¹ᵁ (U : S.Opens) := by
  rw [blowUpToBase_preimage_coe]
  simp only [blowUpAffineChart, Scheme.Hom.opensRange_comp, ← Scheme.Hom.image_iSup,
    iSup_opensRange_specAffineBlowupι_range a ha hspan, Scheme.Hom.image_top_eq_opensRange]

end SchemeCover

section ComapIso

/-- The inverse image of ideal sheaves along an isomorphism is injective. -/
theorem comap_injective_of_iso {X' P : Scheme.{u}} (e : P ≅ X') {𝒦₁ 𝒦₂ : X'.IdealSheafData}
    (h : 𝒦₁.comap e.hom = 𝒦₂.comap e.hom) : 𝒦₁ = 𝒦₂ := by
  have hid : ∀ K : X'.IdealSheafData, (K.comap e.hom).comap e.inv = K := fun K ↦ by
    rw [← Scheme.IdealSheafData.comap_comp, e.inv_hom_id, Scheme.IdealSheafData.comap_id]
  rw [← hid 𝒦₁, ← hid 𝒦₂, h]

end ComapIso

section ChartAppLE

variable {S : Scheme.{u}}

/-- The structure map of an affine open, read through `appLE`, is the inverse of the canonical
identification of `Γ(S, U)` with the global sections of its spectrum. -/
theorem appLE_top_fromSpec (U : S.affineOpens)
    (e : (⊤ : (Spec Γ(S, U.1)).Opens) ≤ (Stacks.RelativeProj.isAffineOpen U).fromSpec ⁻¹ᵁ U.1) :
    ((Stacks.RelativeProj.isAffineOpen U).fromSpec).appLE U.1 ⊤ e
      = (Scheme.ΓSpecIso Γ(S, U.1)).inv := by
  rw [Scheme.Hom.appLE, IsAffineOpen.fromSpec_app_self, Category.assoc, ← Functor.map_comp]
  simp

/-- `Spec` of a ring map, read through `appLE` on global sections. -/
theorem appLE_top_specMap {R T : CommRingCat.{u}} (g : R ⟶ T)
    (e : (⊤ : (Spec T).Opens) ≤ Spec.map g ⁻¹ᵁ (⊤ : (Spec R).Opens)) :
    (Spec.map g).appLE ⊤ ⊤ e = (Scheme.ΓSpecIso R).hom ≫ g ≫ (Scheme.ΓSpecIso T).inv := by
  rw [Scheme.ΓSpecIso_inv_naturality, ← Category.assoc, Iso.hom_inv_id, Category.id_comp,
    Scheme.Hom.appTop, Scheme.Hom.app_eq_appLE]
  rfl

/-- **The affine chart of a blowup over the base, read on sections.** -/
theorem appLE_top_of_eq_specMap_fromSpec {T : CommRingCat.{u}} (U : S.affineOpens)
    {f : Spec T ⟶ S} (g : Γ(S, U.1) ⟶ T)
    (hf : f = Spec.map g ≫ (Stacks.RelativeProj.isAffineOpen U).fromSpec)
    (hle : (⊤ : (Spec T).Opens) ≤ f ⁻¹ᵁ U.1) :
    f.appLE U.1 ⊤ hle = g ≫ (Scheme.ΓSpecIso T).inv := by
  subst hf
  have e1 : (⊤ : (Spec Γ(S, U.1)).Opens) ≤
      (Stacks.RelativeProj.isAffineOpen U).fromSpec ⁻¹ᵁ U.1 :=
    ((Stacks.RelativeProj.isAffineOpen U).fromSpec_preimage_self).ge
  have e2 : (⊤ : (Spec T).Opens) ≤ Spec.map g ⁻¹ᵁ (⊤ : (Spec Γ(S, U.1)).Opens) := le_top
  rw [← Scheme.Hom.appLE_comp_appLE (Spec.map g)
    (Stacks.RelativeProj.isAffineOpen U).fromSpec U.1 ⊤ ⊤ e1 e2,
    appLE_top_fromSpec U e1, appLE_top_specMap g e2, ← Category.assoc, Iso.inv_hom_id,
    Category.id_comp]

end ChartAppLE

section ChartSetup

variable {S : Scheme.{u}} (ℐ : S.IdealSheafData) (U : S.affineOpens) {a : Γ(S, U.1)}
  (ha : a ∈ ℐ.ideal U)

/-- The affine open of the blowup underlying the chart attached to `a ∈ ℐ(U)`. -/
abbrev chartOpens : (blowUp ℐ).affineOpens :=
  ⟨blowUpAffineChart ℐ U ha ''ᵁ ⊤, (isAffineOpen_top _).image_of_isOpenImmersion _⟩

/-- The chart attached to `a ∈ ℐ(U)` is the range of the affine chart `blowUpAffineChart`. -/
theorem chartOpens_coe :
    (chartOpens ℐ U ha).1 = (blowUpAffineChart ℐ U ha).opensRange :=
  Scheme.Hom.image_top_eq_opensRange _

/-- The chart attached to `a ∈ ℐ(U)` lies over `U`. -/
theorem chartOpens_le : (chartOpens ℐ U ha).1 ≤ blowUpToBase ℐ ⁻¹ᵁ (U : S.Opens) := by
  rw [chartOpens_coe, ← iSup_opensRange_blowUpAffineChart ℐ U]
  exact le_iSup (fun r : ℐ.ideal U ↦ (blowUpAffineChart ℐ U r.2).opensRange) ⟨a, ha⟩

/-- The structure map of the blowup, read on the chart attached to `a ∈ ℐ(U)`. -/
def chartStructureMap : Γ(S, U.1) ⟶ Γ(blowUp ℐ, (chartOpens ℐ U ha).1) :=
  (blowUpToBase ℐ).appLE U.1 (chartOpens ℐ U ha).1 (chartOpens_le ℐ U ha)

/-- The sections of the blowup over the chart attached to `a` are the affine blowup algebra. -/
def chartRingIso :
    Γ(blowUp ℐ, (chartOpens ℐ U ha).1) ≅ CommRingCat.of (affineBlowup (ℐ.ideal U) a) :=
  (blowUpAffineChart ℐ U ha).appIso ⊤ ≪≫ Scheme.ΓSpecIso _

/-- The affine chart attached to `a ∈ ℐ(U)`, composed with the blowup morphism, maps into `U`. -/
theorem chartTop_le :
    (⊤ : (Spec (CommRingCat.of (affineBlowup (ℐ.ideal U) a))).Opens) ≤
      (blowUpAffineChart ℐ U ha ≫ blowUpToBase ℐ) ⁻¹ᵁ U.1 := by
  rw [Scheme.Hom.comp_preimage]
  exact (Scheme.Hom.preimage_image_eq (blowUpAffineChart ℐ U ha) ⊤).ge.trans
    ((TopologicalSpace.Opens.map (blowUpAffineChart ℐ U ha).base).map
      (homOfLE (chartOpens_le ℐ U ha))).le

/-- The identification `chartRingIso` is one of `Γ(S, U)`-algebras: the structure map of the
blowup, read through it, is the structure map of the affine blowup algebra. -/
theorem chartStructureMap_chartRingIso :
    chartStructureMap ℐ U ha ≫ (chartRingIso ℐ U ha).hom
      = CommRingCat.ofHom (algebraMap Γ(S, U.1) (affineBlowup (ℐ.ideal U) a)) := by
  have hcomp : chartStructureMap ℐ U ha ≫ ((blowUpAffineChart ℐ U ha).appIso ⊤).hom
      = (blowUpAffineChart ℐ U ha ≫ blowUpToBase ℐ).appLE U.1 ⊤ (chartTop_le ℐ U ha) := by
    rw [chartStructureMap, Scheme.Hom.appIso_hom', Scheme.Hom.appLE_comp_appLE]
  rw [chartRingIso, Iso.trans_hom, ← Category.assoc, hcomp,
    appLE_top_of_eq_specMap_fromSpec U _ (blowUpAffineChart_blowUpToBase ℐ U ha),
    Category.assoc, Iso.inv_hom_id, Category.comp_id]

/-- **The inverse image of an ideal sheaf of the base, read on a chart of the blowup.** -/
theorem ideal_comap_blowUpToBase_chartOpens (𝒥 : S.IdealSheafData) :
    (𝒥.comap (blowUpToBase ℐ)).ideal (chartOpens ℐ U ha)
      = Ideal.map (chartStructureMap ℐ U ha).hom (𝒥.ideal U) :=
  Stacks.IdealSheaf.ideal_comap_appLE 𝒥 (blowUpToBase ℐ) U (chartOpens ℐ U ha)
    (chartOpens_le ℐ U ha)

end ChartSetup

section ChartNumerators

variable {R : Type u} [CommRing R]

/-- A representative `x / aⁿ` of an element of the affine blowup algebra, in the
denominator-free form `aⁿ · z = x`. -/
theorem algebraMap_pow_mul_eq_algebraMap (I : Ideal R) (a : R) (z : affineBlowup I a)
    {n : ℕ} {x : R}
    (hz : (z : Localization.Away a)
      = Localization.mk x (⟨a ^ n, n, rfl⟩ : Submonoid.powers a)) :
    algebraMap R (affineBlowup I a) a ^ n * z = algebraMap R (affineBlowup I a) x := by
  apply Subtype.ext
  rw [Subalgebra.coe_mul, Subalgebra.coe_pow, hz]
  change (algebraMap R (Localization.Away a) a) ^ n *
      (Localization.mk x (⟨a ^ n, n, rfl⟩ : Submonoid.powers a) : Localization.Away a)
    = algebraMap R (Localization.Away a) x
  rw [← map_pow, ← Localization.mk_one_eq_algebraMap, ← Localization.mk_one_eq_algebraMap,
    Localization.mk_mul, Localization.mk_eq_mk_iff, Localization.r_iff_exists]
  exact ⟨1, by simp [mul_comm]⟩

/-- Every element of the affine blowup algebra is a fraction `x / aⁿ` with `x ∈ Iⁿ`, in the
denominator-free form. -/
theorem exists_pow_mul_eq_algebraMap (I : Ideal R) (a : R) (ha : a ∈ I)
    (z : affineBlowup I a) :
    ∃ (n : ℕ) (x : R), x ∈ I ^ n ∧
      algebraMap R (affineBlowup I a) a ^ n * z = algebraMap R (affineBlowup I a) x := by
  obtain ⟨n, x, hx, hz⟩ := (affineBlowup_mem_iff I a ha (z : Localization.Away a)).mp z.2
  exact ⟨n, x, hx, algebraMap_pow_mul_eq_algebraMap I a z hz⟩

end ChartNumerators

section ChartPrincipal

variable {S : Scheme.{u}} (ℐ : S.IdealSheafData) (U : S.affineOpens) {a : Γ(S, U.1)}
  (ha : a ∈ ℐ.ideal U)

/-- A section on a chart satisfies `aⁿ · w = x` as soon as its image in the affine blowup algebra
does. -/
private theorem chartStructureMap_pow_mul_eq {n : ℕ} {x : Γ(S, U.1)}
    {w : Γ(blowUp ℐ, (chartOpens ℐ U ha).1)}
    (h : algebraMap Γ(S, U.1) (affineBlowup (ℐ.ideal U) a) a ^ n * (chartRingIso ℐ U ha).hom.hom w
      = algebraMap Γ(S, U.1) (affineBlowup (ℐ.ideal U) a) x) :
    (chartStructureMap ℐ U ha).hom a ^ n * w = (chartStructureMap ℐ U ha).hom x := by
  refine (chartRingIso ℐ U ha).commRingCatIsoToRingEquiv.injective ?_
  change (chartRingIso ℐ U ha).hom.hom _ = (chartRingIso ℐ U ha).hom.hom _
  rwa [map_mul, map_pow, ← CommRingCat.comp_apply, ← CommRingCat.comp_apply,
    chartStructureMap_chartRingIso]

/-- **The centre of the blowup is principal on a chart.** -/
theorem map_chartStructureMap_ideal :
    Ideal.map (chartStructureMap ℐ U ha).hom (ℐ.ideal U)
      = Ideal.span {(chartStructureMap ℐ U ha).hom a} := by
  refine Stacks.IdealSheaf.ideal_map_hom_injective (chartRingIso ℐ U ha) ?_
  rw [Ideal.map_map, Ideal.map_span, Set.image_singleton, ← CommRingCat.hom_comp,
    chartStructureMap_chartRingIso, ← CommRingCat.comp_apply,
    chartStructureMap_chartRingIso]
  exact affineBlowup_idealMap_eq_span (ℐ.ideal U) a ha

/-- **The numerator form of a section on a chart.** -/
theorem exists_pow_mul_eq_chartStructureMap (g : Γ(blowUp ℐ, (chartOpens ℐ U ha).1)) :
    ∃ (n : ℕ) (x : Γ(S, U.1)), x ∈ ℐ.ideal U ^ n ∧
      (chartStructureMap ℐ U ha).hom a ^ n * g = (chartStructureMap ℐ U ha).hom x := by
  obtain ⟨n, x, hx, hid⟩ := exists_pow_mul_eq_algebraMap (ℐ.ideal U) a ha
    ((chartRingIso ℐ U ha).hom.hom g)
  exact ⟨n, x, hx, chartStructureMap_pow_mul_eq ℐ U ha hid⟩

end ChartPrincipal

section Overlap

variable {R : Type u} [CommRing R] {I : Ideal R} {a b : R} (ha : a ∈ I) (hb : b ∈ I)

/-- The transition element of two charts of a blowup, read in the affine blowup algebra: the
element of `(R[It])_{(a⁽¹⁾)}` that inverts the passage to the chart of `b` is the fraction
`b / a`. -/
theorem reesAwayEquivAffineBlowup_isLocalizationElem :
    ((reesAwayEquivAffineBlowup I a ha
        (Away.isLocalizationElem (reesDegOne_mem_reesGrading I ha)
          (reesDegOne_mem_reesGrading I hb)) : affineBlowup I a) : Localization.Away a)
      = Localization.mk b (⟨a ^ 1, 1, rfl⟩ : Submonoid.powers a) := by
  have hmem : b ∈ I ^ 1 := by simpa using hb
  have hel : Away.isLocalizationElem (reesDegOne_mem_reesGrading I ha)
      (reesDegOne_mem_reesGrading I hb) = reesAwayMk I a ha 1 ⟨b, hmem⟩ := by
    apply HomogeneousLocalization.val_injective
    change (Away.mk (reesGrading I) (reesDegOne_mem_reesGrading I ha) 1
        (reesDegOne I hb ^ 1) _).val = _
    rw [reesAwayMk, Away.val_mk, Away.val_mk]
    congr 1
    exact Subtype.ext (by rw [pow_one, coe_reesDegOne, coe_reesMonomial])
  rw [hel, coe_reesAwayEquivAffineBlowup_reesAwayMk]

/-- **The overlap of two charts, read on one of them.** The preimage on the chart of `a` of the
chart of `b` is the locus where the transition element `b / a` is invertible. -/
theorem preimage_basicOpen_specAffineBlowupι :
    specAffineBlowupι I a ha ⁻¹ᵁ Proj.basicOpen (reesGrading I) (reesDegOne I hb)
      = PrimeSpectrum.basicOpen (reesAwayEquivAffineBlowup I a ha
          (Away.isLocalizationElem (reesDegOne_mem_reesGrading I ha)
            (reesDegOne_mem_reesGrading I hb))) := by
  rw [specAffineBlowupι, Scheme.Hom.comp_preimage,
    Proj.awayι_preimage_basicOpen (𝒜 := reesGrading I)
      (f_deg := reesDegOne_mem_reesGrading I ha) (hm := Nat.one_pos)
      (g_deg := reesDegOne_mem_reesGrading I hb) (hm' := Nat.one_pos),
    AlgebraicGeometry.SpecMap_preimage_basicOpen]
  rfl

end Overlap

section OverlapScheme

variable {S : Scheme.{u}} (ℐ : S.IdealSheafData) (U : S.affineOpens) {a b : Γ(S, U.1)}
  (ha : a ∈ ℐ.ideal U) (hb : b ∈ ℐ.ideal U)

/-- **The overlap of two charts of a blowup, read on one of them.** -/
theorem preimage_chartOpens :
    blowUpAffineChart ℐ U ha ⁻¹ᵁ (chartOpens ℐ U hb).1
      = PrimeSpectrum.basicOpen (reesAwayEquivAffineBlowup (ℐ.ideal U) a ha
          (Away.isLocalizationElem (reesDegOne_mem_reesGrading (ℐ.ideal U) ha)
            (reesDegOne_mem_reesGrading (ℐ.ideal U) hb))) := by
  have hr : (blowUpAffineChart ℐ U hb).opensRange
      = blowUpChart ℐ U ''ᵁ
        Proj.basicOpen (reesGrading (ℐ.ideal U)) (reesDegOne (ℐ.ideal U) hb) := by
    rw [← opensRange_specAffineBlowupι (ℐ.ideal U) b hb]
    exact Scheme.Hom.opensRange_comp _ _
  have e1 : (chartOpens ℐ U hb).1
      = blowUpChart ℐ U ''ᵁ
        Proj.basicOpen (reesGrading (ℐ.ideal U)) (reesDegOne (ℐ.ideal U) hb) :=
    (Scheme.Hom.image_top_eq_opensRange (blowUpAffineChart ℐ U hb)).trans hr
  have e2 : blowUpAffineChart ℐ U ha ⁻¹ᵁ (chartOpens ℐ U hb).1
      = specAffineBlowupι (ℐ.ideal U) a ha ⁻¹ᵁ
        Proj.basicOpen (reesGrading (ℐ.ideal U)) (reesDegOne (ℐ.ideal U) hb) := by
    rw [e1]
    change (specAffineBlowupι (ℐ.ideal U) a ha ≫ blowUpChart ℐ U) ⁻¹ᵁ _ = _
    exact (Scheme.Hom.comp_preimage (specAffineBlowupι (ℐ.ideal U) a ha)
      (blowUpChart ℐ U) _).trans (congrArg _ (Scheme.Hom.preimage_image_eq (blowUpChart ℐ U) _))
  rw [e2, preimage_basicOpen_specAffineBlowupι ha hb]

end OverlapScheme

section OverlapSections

variable {S : Scheme.{u}} (ℐ : S.IdealSheafData) (U : S.affineOpens) {a b : Γ(S, U.1)}
  (ha : a ∈ ℐ.ideal U) (hb : b ∈ ℐ.ideal U)

private theorem hom_inv_chartRingIso (z : affineBlowup (ℐ.ideal U) a) :
    (chartRingIso ℐ U ha).hom.hom ((chartRingIso ℐ U ha).inv.hom z) = z := by
  rw [← CommRingCat.comp_apply, Iso.inv_hom_id]
  rfl

private theorem chartRingIso_inv_appIso_hom :
    (chartRingIso ℐ U ha).inv ≫ ((blowUpAffineChart ℐ U ha).appIso
        (⊤ : (Spec (CommRingCat.of (affineBlowup (ℐ.ideal U) a))).Opens)).hom
      = (Scheme.ΓSpecIso (CommRingCat.of (affineBlowup (ℐ.ideal U) a))).inv := by
  change ((Scheme.ΓSpecIso (CommRingCat.of (affineBlowup (ℐ.ideal U) a))).inv
    ≫ ((blowUpAffineChart ℐ U ha).appIso _).inv) ≫ _ = _
  rw [Category.assoc, Iso.inv_hom_id, Category.comp_id]

private theorem appIso_hom_chartRingIso_inv (z : affineBlowup (ℐ.ideal U) a) :
    ((blowUpAffineChart ℐ U ha).appIso
        (⊤ : (Spec (CommRingCat.of (affineBlowup (ℐ.ideal U) a))).Opens)).hom.hom
          ((chartRingIso ℐ U ha).inv.hom z)
      = (Scheme.ΓSpecIso (CommRingCat.of (affineBlowup (ℐ.ideal U) a))).inv.hom z := by
  rw [← CommRingCat.comp_apply, chartRingIso_inv_appIso_hom]

/-- The locus on the blowup where a section of the chart of `a` is invertible, read on the
chart. -/
theorem preimage_basicOpen_chartRingIso_inv (z : affineBlowup (ℐ.ideal U) a) :
    blowUpAffineChart ℐ U ha ⁻¹ᵁ ((blowUp ℐ).basicOpen ((chartRingIso ℐ U ha).inv.hom z))
      = PrimeSpectrum.basicOpen z := by
  have h1 : blowUpAffineChart ℐ U ha ⁻¹ᵁ
        ((blowUp ℐ).basicOpen ((chartRingIso ℐ U ha).inv.hom z))
      = (Spec (CommRingCat.of (affineBlowup (ℐ.ideal U) a))).basicOpen
        (((blowUpAffineChart ℐ U ha).appIso
          (⊤ : (Spec (CommRingCat.of (affineBlowup (ℐ.ideal U) a))).Opens)).hom.hom
            ((chartRingIso ℐ U ha).inv.hom z)) := by
    rw [Scheme.Hom.appIso_hom', Scheme.basicOpen_appLE, top_inf_eq]
  rw [h1, appIso_hom_chartRingIso_inv, AlgebraicGeometry.basicOpen_eq_of_affine]

/-- **A fraction `x / aⁿ` as a section of the blowup over the chart of `a`.** -/
theorem exists_pow_mul_eq_chartStructureMap_of_mem_pow {n : ℕ} {x : Γ(S, U.1)}
    (hx : x ∈ ℐ.ideal U ^ n) :
    ∃ w : Γ(blowUp ℐ, (chartOpens ℐ U ha).1),
      (chartStructureMap ℐ U ha).hom a ^ n * w = (chartStructureMap ℐ U ha).hom x := by
  refine ⟨(chartRingIso ℐ U ha).inv.hom
    ⟨Localization.mk x (⟨a ^ n, n, rfl⟩ : Submonoid.powers a),
      mk_mem_affineBlowup_of_mem_pow (ℐ.ideal U) a hx⟩, ?_⟩
  refine chartStructureMap_pow_mul_eq ℐ U ha ?_
  rw [hom_inv_chartRingIso]
  exact algebraMap_pow_mul_eq_algebraMap (ℐ.ideal U) a _ rfl

/-- The locus where a section of the chart of `a` is invertible is contained in any open whose
preimage on the chart is the locus where the corresponding element is invertible. -/
theorem basicOpen_chartRingIso_inv_le (z : affineBlowup (ℐ.ideal U) a) (W : (blowUp ℐ).Opens)
    (hW : blowUpAffineChart ℐ U ha ⁻¹ᵁ W = PrimeSpectrum.basicOpen z) :
    (blowUp ℐ).basicOpen ((chartRingIso ℐ U ha).inv.hom z) ≤ W := by
  calc (blowUp ℐ).basicOpen ((chartRingIso ℐ U ha).inv.hom z)
      = blowUpAffineChart ℐ U ha ''ᵁ (blowUpAffineChart ℐ U ha ⁻¹ᵁ
          ((blowUp ℐ).basicOpen ((chartRingIso ℐ U ha).inv.hom z))) := by
        rw [Scheme.Hom.image_preimage_eq_opensRange_inf]
        exact (inf_eq_right.mpr ((chartOpens_coe ℐ U ha) ▸ (Scheme.basicOpen_le _ _))).symm
    _ = blowUpAffineChart ℐ U ha ''ᵁ (blowUpAffineChart ℐ U ha ⁻¹ᵁ W) := by
        rw [preimage_basicOpen_chartRingIso_inv, hW]
    _ ≤ W := by
        rw [Scheme.Hom.image_preimage_eq_opensRange_inf]
        exact inf_le_right

/-- **The transition section between two charts of a blowup.** On the chart of `a` there is a
section `s` with `a · s = b`, and the locus where `s` is invertible is contained in the chart
of `b`. -/
theorem exists_mul_eq_and_basicOpen_le :
    ∃ s : Γ(blowUp ℐ, (chartOpens ℐ U ha).1),
      (chartStructureMap ℐ U ha).hom a * s = (chartStructureMap ℐ U ha).hom b ∧
        (blowUp ℐ).basicOpen s ≤ (chartOpens ℐ U hb).1 := by
  refine ⟨(chartRingIso ℐ U ha).inv.hom (reesAwayEquivAffineBlowup (ℐ.ideal U) a ha
    (Away.isLocalizationElem (reesDegOne_mem_reesGrading (ℐ.ideal U) ha)
      (reesDegOne_mem_reesGrading (ℐ.ideal U) hb))), ?_, ?_⟩
  · rw [← pow_one ((chartStructureMap ℐ U ha).hom a)]
    refine chartStructureMap_pow_mul_eq ℐ U ha ?_
    rw [hom_inv_chartRingIso]
    exact algebraMap_pow_mul_eq_algebraMap (ℐ.ideal U) a _
      (reesAwayEquivAffineBlowup_isLocalizationElem ha hb)
  · exact basicOpen_chartRingIso_inv_le ℐ U ha _ _ (preimage_chartOpens ℐ U ha hb)

end OverlapSections

section Clear

variable {S : Scheme.{u}} (ℐ : S.IdealSheafData) (U : S.affineOpens) {a b : Γ(S, U.1)}
  (ha : a ∈ ℐ.ideal U) (hb : b ∈ ℐ.ideal U)

/-- The structure map of the blowup, read on the chart of `a`, is the structure map composed
with the chart identification. -/
theorem chartStructureMap_eq :
    chartStructureMap ℐ U ha
      = CommRingCat.ofHom (algebraMap Γ(S, U.1) (affineBlowup (ℐ.ideal U) a))
        ≫ (chartRingIso ℐ U ha).inv := by
  rw [← chartStructureMap_chartRingIso, Category.assoc, Iso.hom_inv_id, Category.comp_id]

/-- The local generator of the centre on a chart is a nonzerodivisor. -/
theorem chartStructureMap_mem_nonZeroDivisors :
    (chartStructureMap ℐ U ha).hom a
      ∈ nonZeroDivisors Γ(blowUp ℐ, (chartOpens ℐ U ha).1) := by
  have h0 : (chartStructureMap ℐ U ha).hom a
      = (chartRingIso ℐ U ha).symm.hom.hom
        (algebraMap Γ(S, U.1) (affineBlowup (ℐ.ideal U) a) a) := by
    rw [chartStructureMap_eq ℐ U ha]
    rfl
  rw [h0]
  exact mem_nonZeroDivisors_iso _
    (algebraMap_affineBlowup_mem_nonZeroDivisors (ℐ.ideal U) a)

/-- The structure maps of two charts agree after restriction to an open inside both charts. -/
theorem map_chartStructureMap_eq {W : (blowUp ℐ).Opens}
    (hWa : W ≤ (chartOpens ℐ U ha).1) (hWb : W ≤ (chartOpens ℐ U hb).1) (y : Γ(S, U.1)) :
    ((blowUp ℐ).presheaf.map (homOfLE hWa).op).hom ((chartStructureMap ℐ U ha).hom y)
      = ((blowUp ℐ).presheaf.map (homOfLE hWb).op).hom ((chartStructureMap ℐ U hb).hom y) := by
  have h₁ : chartStructureMap ℐ U ha ≫ (blowUp ℐ).presheaf.map (homOfLE hWa).op
      = (blowUpToBase ℐ).appLE U.1 W (hWa.trans (chartOpens_le ℐ U ha)) :=
    Scheme.Hom.appLE_map _ _ _
  have h₂ : chartStructureMap ℐ U hb ≫ (blowUp ℐ).presheaf.map (homOfLE hWb).op
      = (blowUpToBase ℐ).appLE U.1 W (hWa.trans (chartOpens_le ℐ U ha)) :=
    Scheme.Hom.appLE_map _ _ _
  rw [← CommRingCat.comp_apply, ← CommRingCat.comp_apply, h₁, h₂]

/-- **Clearing denominators between two charts.** A generator of an ideal sheaf on the chart of
`b`, written as a fraction with numerator `x` over `bⁿ`, lands in the ideal on the chart of `a`
after multiplication by a high enough power of `a`. -/
theorem exists_pow_mul_mem_chart (𝒦 : (blowUp ℐ).IdealSheafData)
    {n : ℕ} {x : Γ(S, U.1)} (hx : x ∈ ℐ.ideal U ^ n)
    (z : Γ(blowUp ℐ, (chartOpens ℐ U hb).1)) (hz : z ∈ 𝒦.ideal (chartOpens ℐ U hb))
    (hzx : (chartStructureMap ℐ U hb).hom b ^ n * z = (chartStructureMap ℐ U hb).hom x) :
    ∃ (N : ℕ) (v : Γ(blowUp ℐ, (chartOpens ℐ U ha).1)),
      v ∈ 𝒦.ideal (chartOpens ℐ U ha) ∧
        (chartStructureMap ℐ U ha).hom a ^ (n + N) * v
          = (chartStructureMap ℐ U ha).hom (b ^ N * x) := by
  obtain ⟨s, hsab, hsle⟩ := exists_mul_eq_and_basicOpen_le ℐ U ha hb
  obtain ⟨w, hw⟩ := exists_pow_mul_eq_chartStructureMap_of_mem_pow ℐ U ha hx
  have hOa : (blowUp ℐ).basicOpen s ≤ (chartOpens ℐ U ha).1 := (blowUp ℐ).basicOpen_le s
  set ρa := ((blowUp ℐ).presheaf.map (homOfLE hOa).op).hom with hρa
  set ρb := ((blowUp ℐ).presheaf.map (homOfLE hsle).op).hom
  have hbase : ∀ y : Γ(S, U.1),
      ρa ((chartStructureMap ℐ U ha).hom y) = ρb ((chartStructureMap ℐ U hb).hom y) :=
    map_chartStructureMap_eq ℐ U ha hb hOa hsle
  have hloc : IsLocalization.Away s Γ(blowUp ℐ, (blowUp ℐ).basicOpen s) :=
    (chartOpens ℐ U ha).2.isLocalization_basicOpen s
  have hnzdC : ρa ((chartStructureMap ℐ U ha).hom a)
      ∈ nonZeroDivisors Γ(blowUp ℐ, (blowUp ℐ).basicOpen s) :=
    IsLocalization.map_nonZeroDivisors_le (M := Submonoid.powers s)
      (S := Γ(blowUp ℐ, (blowUp ℐ).basicOpen s))
      (Submonoid.mem_map.mpr ⟨_, chartStructureMap_mem_nonZeroDivisors ℐ U ha, rfl⟩)
  have hkey : ρa w = ρa s ^ n * ρb z := by
    refine (mul_cancel_left_mem_nonZeroDivisors (pow_mem hnzdC n)).mp ?_
    calc ρa ((chartStructureMap ℐ U ha).hom a) ^ n * ρa w
        = ρa ((chartStructureMap ℐ U ha).hom a ^ n * w) := by rw [map_mul, map_pow]
      _ = ρb ((chartStructureMap ℐ U hb).hom x) := by rw [hw, hbase]
      _ = ρb ((chartStructureMap ℐ U hb).hom b ^ n * z) := by rw [hzx]
      _ = ρb ((chartStructureMap ℐ U hb).hom b) ^ n * ρb z := by rw [map_mul, map_pow]
      _ = (ρa ((chartStructureMap ℐ U ha).hom a) * ρa s) ^ n * ρb z := by
          rw [← map_mul, hsab, hbase]
      _ = ρa ((chartStructureMap ℐ U ha).hom a) ^ n * (ρa s ^ n * ρb z) := by
          rw [mul_pow, mul_assoc]
  have hmem : ρa w ∈ Ideal.map ρa (𝒦.ideal (chartOpens ℐ U ha)) := by
    rw [hρa, 𝒦.map_ideal_basicOpen (chartOpens ℐ U ha) s, hkey]
    refine Ideal.mul_mem_left _ _ ?_
    rw [← 𝒦.map_ideal (U := (blowUp ℐ).affineBasicOpen s) (V := chartOpens ℐ U hb) hsle]
    exact Ideal.mem_map_of_mem _ hz
  obtain ⟨N, hN⟩ := exists_pow_mul_mem_of_algebraMap_mem_map
    (𝒦.ideal (chartOpens ℐ U ha)) s w
    (L := Γ(blowUp ℐ, (blowUp ℐ).basicOpen s)) hmem
  exact ⟨N, s ^ N * w, hN,
    pow_mul_eq_map_of_pow_mul_eq (chartStructureMap ℐ U ha).hom hsab hw N⟩

end Clear

section ChartFactorization

variable {S : Scheme.{u}} (ℐ : S.IdealSheafData) (U : S.affineOpens)

/-- **The second-centre factorization over an affine open, chart by chart.** Let `ℐ` be a
quasi-coherent ideal sheaf on `S`, let `U ⊆ S` be an affine open and let `a : ι → Γ(S, U)` be a
finite family of sections of `ℐ(U)`. For a finite type quasi-coherent ideal sheaf `𝒦` on the
blowup there are a `d > 0` and a finitely generated ideal `J ⊆ ℐ(U)ᵈ` whose extension to each
of the charts attached to the `a i` is `(ℐ(U)·𝒪)ᵈ · 𝒦`. -/
theorem exists_fg_le_pow_and_map_chartStructureMap_eq {ι : Type*} [Finite ι]
    (a : ι → Γ(S, U.1)) (ha : ∀ i, a i ∈ ℐ.ideal U)
    (𝒦 : (blowUp ℐ).IdealSheafData) (h𝒦 : ∀ W, (𝒦.ideal W).FG) :
    ∃ d : ℕ, 0 < d ∧ ∃ J : Ideal Γ(S, U.1), J.FG ∧ J ≤ ℐ.ideal U ^ d ∧
      ∀ i, Ideal.map (chartStructureMap ℐ U (ha i)).hom J
        = Ideal.map (chartStructureMap ℐ U (ha i)).hom (ℐ.ideal U) ^ d
          * 𝒦.ideal (chartOpens ℐ U (ha i)) := by
  classical
  choose t ht using fun i ↦ h𝒦 (chartOpens ℐ U (ha i))
  have hK : ∀ i, 𝒦.ideal (chartOpens ℐ U (ha i))
      = Ideal.span (Set.range fun l : {y // y ∈ t i} ↦ (l : Γ(blowUp ℐ, _))) := by
    intro i
    rw [← ht i]
    congr 1
    exact (Subtype.range_coe (s := (t i : Set Γ(blowUp ℐ, (chartOpens ℐ U (ha i)).1)))).symm
  have hmemz : ∀ i (l : {y // y ∈ t i}), (l : Γ(blowUp ℐ, _))
      ∈ 𝒦.ideal (chartOpens ℐ U (ha i)) := fun i l ↦ (ht i).le (Ideal.subset_span l.2)
  choose n x hx num using fun i (l : {y // y ∈ t i}) ↦
    exists_pow_mul_eq_chartStructureMap ℐ U (ha i) (l : Γ(blowUp ℐ, _))
  exact exists_fg_le_pow_map_eq_pow_mul (ℐ.ideal U) a ha
    (fun i ↦ (chartStructureMap ℐ U (ha i)).hom)
    (fun i ↦ 𝒦.ideal (chartOpens ℐ U (ha i)))
    (fun i ↦ map_chartStructureMap_ideal ℐ U (ha i))
    (fun i (l : {y // y ∈ t i}) ↦ (l : Γ(blowUp ℐ, _))) hK n x hx num
    (fun i j l ↦ exists_pow_mul_mem_chart ℐ U (ha j) (ha i) 𝒦 (hx i l) _ (hmemz i l) (num i l))

/-- **The second-centre factorization over an affine open, with the degree free to grow.** -/
theorem exists_pos_forall_ge_fg_le_pow_and_map_chartStructureMap_eq {ι : Type*} [Finite ι]
    (a : ι → Γ(S, U.1)) (ha : ∀ i, a i ∈ ℐ.ideal U) (hfgU : (ℐ.ideal U).FG)
    (𝒦 : (blowUp ℐ).IdealSheafData) (h𝒦 : ∀ W, (𝒦.ideal W).FG) :
    ∃ d : ℕ, 0 < d ∧ ∀ D : ℕ, d ≤ D →
      ∃ J : Ideal Γ(S, U.1), J.FG ∧ J ≤ ℐ.ideal U ^ D ∧
        ∀ i, Ideal.map (chartStructureMap ℐ U (ha i)).hom J
          = Ideal.map (chartStructureMap ℐ U (ha i)).hom (ℐ.ideal U) ^ D
            * 𝒦.ideal (chartOpens ℐ U (ha i)) := by
  obtain ⟨d, hd, J, hJfg, hJle, hJchart⟩ :=
    exists_fg_le_pow_and_map_chartStructureMap_eq ℐ U a ha 𝒦 h𝒦
  refine ⟨d, hd, fun D hD ↦ ⟨J * ℐ.ideal U ^ (D - d), hJfg.mul hfgU.pow, ?_, fun i ↦ ?_⟩⟩
  · calc J * ℐ.ideal U ^ (D - d) ≤ ℐ.ideal U ^ d * ℐ.ideal U ^ (D - d) :=
          Ideal.mul_mono_left hJle
      _ = ℐ.ideal U ^ D := by rw [← pow_add, Nat.add_sub_cancel' hD]
  · rw [Ideal.map_mul, Ideal.map_pow, hJchart i, mul_right_comm, ← pow_add,
      Nat.add_sub_cancel' hD]

end ChartFactorization

end Stacks.Blowup

